WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.469
An angle opens 20 degrees. Is it acute, right or obtuse? Let us think carefully.

00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:11.440
Acute is less than 90 degrees , right is 90 degrees , and obtuse is between 90

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:15.304
degrees and 180 degrees . The answer is acute. Great work!

